      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "UPSCALE VIDEO - SEEDVR2 (diffusion restore, best quality, slow)\n\nRe-draws detail with temporal consistency. Use it for short clips and the\nshots that matter; use the FAST workflow for whole movies.\n\n1. Load Video: pick or upload the clip.\n2. Resize: shorter_size = output height (1080 default; the model works at the\n   output size, so 2160 is roughly 4x slower and needs an 80 GB card).\n3. Load Diffusion Model: seedvr2_3b_fp16 is downloaded at pod start (a few\n   minutes after boot; press R to refresh the list if it is missing).\n4. Post-Process: color_correction_method lab keeps the source colors.\n5. Video Combine: crf 16-20 (x264), or cq about crf + 6 on an NVENC GPU; audio is carried over.\n\nframes_per_batch (Meta Batch Manager) is how many frames SeedVR2 sees at once.\nLarger = smoother across cuts but more RAM; keep it 4n+1 (81, 97, 121).\nOutput lands in output/ as upscaled-*-audio.mp4."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
